*> vybe-test: cobol/category_call_returning/test_call_ret_character_value
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_category_call_returning.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. PROGRAM-ID. T. DATA DIVISION. WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256). 01 R PIC X(3). PROCEDURE DIVISION. CALL 'S1' RETURNING R. DISPLAY R.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING R DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "R1T"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [R1T] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF. STOP RUN. IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. PROGRAM-ID. S1. DATA DIVISION. LINKAGE SECTION. 01 RR PIC X(3). PROCEDURE DIVISION RETURNING RR. MOVE 'R1T' TO RR. EXIT PROGRAM. END PROGRAM S1.

